  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Il a été tire, pour le compte de Lebeer Hossmann, éditeurs de cet atlas au format de miniscule. 50 exemplaires signés et numérotés de 1 à 50 et 5 exemplaires d'artiste marqués de I à V. Le tout constituant l'édition originale"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Hémisphère Nord -- Hémisphère Sud -- Afrique du Sud -- Allegmagne -- Andorre -- Angleterre -- Australie -- Autriche -- Belgique -- Canada -- Danemark -- Espagne -- Finlande -- France -- Grèce -- Haïti -- Italie -- Irlande -- Islande -- Japon -- Liechtenstein -- Luxembourg -- Monaco -- Nigéria -- Norvège -- Nouvelle Zélande -- Pays-Bas -- Portugal -- Sénégal -- Suède -- Suisse -- Turquie -- U.S.A. -- Zaïre.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Miniature atlas of 34 maps, two of the northern and southern hemispheres and 32 of individual countries in alphabetical order. The countries are printed entirely in black, without any internal divisions or details. The countries included are largely European, with a handful from Asia, Africa, and North America. South American countries are not represented.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Library's copy is restricted; see facsimile copies shelved under call number N7433.4.B871 C75 2016 in Special Collections (2016-B118).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Library's copy is numbered 35 from an edition of 50 and 5 artist's proofs, stamped by estate of Broodthaers.</subfield>
  </datafield>
